---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Japan Unpacked"
  description="What Japan Unpacked collects, why, and how to opt out."
>
  <h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated: 2026-08-28</p>

  <article class="prose prose-stone mt-6 max-w-none">
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Google Analytics 4 to understand how many people visit
      and which pages and affiliate links they follow. It only runs after
      you accept the cookie banner — nothing is collected before that. IP
      addresses are anonymized. You can decline, and you can clear your
      choice at any time by clearing this site's data in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site may show ads served by Google AdSense to help cover running
      costs. Like Analytics, AdSense's script and any related cookies only
      load after you accept the cookie banner — nothing loads before that,
      and declining keeps this page ad-free (and cookie-free) for you.
      Google's ad-serving cookies may be used to serve ads based on your
      prior visits to this and other sites; you can opt out of personalized
      advertising by visiting{" "}
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="underline">
        Google's Ads Settings
      </a>{" "}
      or{" "}
      <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" class="underline">
        aboutads.info
      </a>
      .
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      This site earns commissions from qualifying purchases and bookings
      made through affiliate links (Amazon Associates, Japan Trend Shop,
      Klook, Viator, GetYourGuide, Rakuten Travel, and Amazon's own
      subscription referral programs), at no extra cost to you. Clicking an
      affiliate link may set a cookie on the destination site (e.g. Amazon)
      that is controlled by that site, not by us.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be directed through this site's
      GitHub repository.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm text-ink-faint">
      This is a plain-language summary, not a substitute for legal advice.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
